@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title exception evidence lifecycle (proposed; not deployed)
[*] --> Submitted
Submitted --> Validated : independent evidence
Submitted --> Escalated : insufficient evidence
Validated --> ReviewPending
ReviewPending --> Approved : independent authorization
ReviewPending --> Denied
Approved --> CandidateMatch : exact scope
CandidateMatch --> Executed : future authorized API and recheck
CandidateMatch --> Escalated : mismatch / changed head
Approved --> Expired : elapsed / invalidated
Executed --> Reconciled : observe GitHub state
Executed --> Escalated : partial failure
Reconciled --> Revoked : control change
Revoked --> Escalated : reopen investigation
@enduml
